# BOTSHIELD - Detection of Malicious Social Bots Using Machine Learning

BOTSHIELD is a web application developed to detect malicious social media bot accounts using Machine Learning. The application allows users to register, log in, enter social media account metrics, and predict whether an account is Legitimate or Malicious.

## Features

- User Registration and Login
- Secure Authentication
- Dashboard for Bot Detection
- Machine Learning Prediction
- Confidence Score Display
- View Prediction History
- User Management
- Profile Management
- Responsive User Interface

## Technologies Used

### Frontend

- React.js
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Bootstrap

### Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js

### Database

- MongoDB

### Machine Learning

- Python
- Scikit-learn
- Pandas
- NumPy

## Input Features

The model predicts whether an account is malicious using:

- Username
- Followers Count
- Following Count
- Tweets Posted
- Media Tweets
- Replies Count
- Engagement Time
- Likes Given
- Likes Received
- Retweets

