## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YourUsername/BOTSHIELD.git
```

### Move into Project

```bash
cd BOTSHIELD
```

### Install Frontend

```bash
cd client
npm install
```

### Install Backend

```bash
cd ../server
npm install
```

### Install Python Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Machine Learning Model

The trained Machine Learning model analyzes social media account statistics and classifies them as:

- Legitimate User
- Malicious Bot

It also provides a confidence score for each prediction.

